025-01-31","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250131900560"},{"id":"D16","kind":"DART 공시","title":"단일판매ㆍ공급계약체결(자율공시)","date":"2024-12-18","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20241218900154"},{"id":"D17","kind":"DART 공시","title":"단일판매ㆍ공급계약체결","date":"2024-08-09","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240809900300"},{"id":"D18","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환청구권행사","date":"2024-04-30","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240430900598"},{"id":"D19","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환가액의조정","date":"2024-01-08","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240108900494"},{"id":"D20","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환가액의조정","date":"2023-11-13","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231113900477"},{"id":"D21","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환가액의조정","date":"2023-08-22","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230822900252"},{"id":"D22","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환청구권행사","date":"2023-08-01","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230801900355"},{"id":"D23","kind":"DART 공시","title":"최대주주변경을수반하는주식담보제공계약체결","date":"2023-06-30","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230630900816"},{"id":"D24","kind":"DART 공시","title":"대표이사변경","date":"2023-06-30","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230630900529"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-21","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250321001389"}]}